| `exit` | the number `0` — a nonzero exit is a failed build, not a report |
| `log` | the entry's step log filename (grammar below) |

The acceptance step log you write is
`bd-ok4pr.1.3.1786119304518562984_step{N}.log`, where `N` is the entry's 1-based
